The loops in these banks were rendered with tools/make_bank.py, then lowered with tools/lower_bank.py
at its default settings.

From the engine scripts of engine-sim (https://github.com/ange-yaghi/engine-sim,
commit 85f7c3b959a908ed5232ede4f1a4ac7eafe6b630), recorded with tools/esrec:

  bmw_m52      assets/engines/bmw/M52B28.mr
  f1_car       assets/engines/atg-video-2/12_ferrari_412_t2.mr
  ferrari_f136 assets/engines/atg-video-2/08_ferrari_f136_v8.mr
  lfa          assets/engines/atg-video-2/10_lfa_v10.mr
  supra_turbo  assets/engines/atg-video-2/03_2jz.mr

From a recording of a real car supplied for this project, built with tools/bank_from_recording.py and equalised with
tools/lower_bank.py --pitch 1.0 --off-mix 0 --off-mid 0:

  hellcat      hellcat.wav: --cylinders 8 --anchor 14 700 --idle 10.5-17.5 --on 25-94 --off 94-119

